+"""A tiny spreadsheet formula engine (see README.md for the semantics).
+
+A cell value is either a bare number (``"2"``) or a formula (``"=A+3"``).
+``evaluate`` parses every cell once, then resolves cells lazily in dependency
+order, raising :class:`CycleError` if a cell reaches itself.
+"""
+
+import re
 
 
